# Styling Reference

Always use the design system defined in `frontend/STYLING_REFERENCE.md` and `frontend/lib/design-tokens.ts`.

## Colors
- **Primary (red):** `#8F113B` → `brand-primary`, `text-brand-primary`, `bg-brand-primary`
- **Secondary (white):** `#FFFFFF` → `brand-secondary`, `bg-secondary`
- **Tertiary (grey):** `#c6c6c6` → `brand-tertiary`, `border-brand-tertiary`

## Gradients
Use tertiary color gradients on page backgrounds: `bg-gradient-tertiary` or `from-brand-tertiary/20 to-secondary`.

## Fonts
- `font-primary` – body text (Alteix Sans)
- `font-secondary` – headings (Timeburner)
- `font-tertiary` – labels, captions (Queensides)

## Buttons
Primary actions: `bg-brand-primary text-white` (red button).
